        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 5<br/>Fri 16</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Ubud to the coast</h3><p>Morning yoga, then transfer south to the cliffs of Uluwatu. Settle into your clifftop villa and watch the sun set over the ocean.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Clifftop villa, Uluwatu · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
