        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 7<br/>Sun 18</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Sunset at the temple</h3><p>A final yoga practice and closing circle, then sunset at Uluwatu temple with the Kecak fire dance, followed by a farewell seafood dinner on the sand.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Clifftop villa, Uluwatu · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
